e is started.<\/li><li>If the retest fails, the lights from the handset and car will flash and an alarm sound will play until the engine is switched off.<\/li><li>Failing the retest will get the driver locked out for 15 minutes.<\/li><\/ul>","enlarge_text":false}}},"block_order":["heading_WCyCQi","text_MTY9qk"],"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Car_ignition_interlock_device_banner.webp","video_external":"","video_description":"","video_autoplay":false,"layout":"left","image_fit":"cover","media_width":45,"media_scale":100,"text_align":"text-start","color_scheme":"none","only_content_color_scheme":false}},"multi_column_eJdnRF":{"type":"multi-column","blocks":{"column_nym9U6":{"type":"column","repeater":"{{ product.metafields.custom.how_to_use.value }}","settings":{"enable_media":false,"image":"{{ block.repeater.image_step_1.value }}","media_scale":100,"heading":"{{ block.repeater.heading_step_1.value }}","text":"{{ block.repeater.description_step_1 | metafield_tag }}","button_label":"{{ block.repeater.model.value }}","button_link":""}}},"block_order":["column_nym9U6"],"settings":{"title":"How to use the {{ product.title }}","heading_align":"text-start","button_label":"","button_link":"","layout":"grid","column_size":"small","column_align":"left","media_align":"text-left","image_ratio":"1","color_scheme":"none","button_style":"link"}},"multi_column_JQy6ny":{"type":"multi-column","blocks":{"column_TTaN4Y":{"type":"column","repeater":"{{ product.metafields.custom.media_gallery.value }}","settings":{"enable_media":true,"image":"{{ block.repeater.image.value }}","media_scale":100,"heading":"{{ block.repeater.subheading.value }}","text":"{{ block.repeater.heading | metafield_tag }}","button_label":"{{ block.repeater.link_label.value }}","button_link":"{{ block.repeater.link_url.value }}"}}},"block_order":["column_TTaN4Y"],"settings":{"title":"As featured on","heading_align":"text-start","button_label":"","button_link":"","layout":"grid","column_size":"medium","column_align":"left","media_align":"text-center","image_ratio":"shortest","color_scheme":"none","button_style":"link"}},"faq_BHziBM":{"type":"faq","blocks":{"category_mjwUde":{"type":"category","settings":{"text":"Please read these FAQs before purchasing"}},"question_xmif3M":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"none","heading":"How can I purchase the ALX3000?","text":"<p>At the moment, the ALX3000 is only available in Victoria as the device needs to be installed by us in our Vermont office.<br\/><br\/>Additionally, the device needs to come back to us for calibration on a yearly basis. Please contact our sales team for a quote.<\/p><p>Purchasing for your company or business? Talk to us about your requirements - we offer corporate and industry pricing on all our products.<\/p>"}},"question_w77zGA":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"none","heading":"Can I get the ALX3000 for a court mandated order?","text":"<p>The ALX3000 interlock is suitable for voluntary use only. If you have a court mandated order to install an interlock, please check with your local governing body to find approved models and installers in your area.<\/p>"}},"question_7d7HnF":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"none","heading":"How do I get the ALX3000 installed in my car?","text":"<p>Please contact us first with your car year, make and model and we will provide you with a quote for installation.<\/p>"}},"question_RQFKXP":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"none","heading":"What's involved in the ALX3000 calibration (price, procedure)?","text":"<p>The ALX3000 interlock requires annual calibration to ensure it remains accurate and functions correctly. You will need to drive your vehicle to our Vermont (VIC) office, and the calibration process will take approximately half a day.<\/p><p>The service includes calibrating the interlock breathalyser for accuracy and checking the control box.<\/p><p>For calibration pricing and to book a service, please visit our <a href=\"https:\/\/andatech.com.au\/collections\/breathalyser-calibrations\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https:\/\/andatech.com.au\/collections\/breathalyser-calibrations\">calibration information page<\/a> or contact our support team to schedule an appointment.<\/p>"}},"question_7tUxeQ":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"none","heading":"How long is the warranty on the ALX3000?","text":"<p>The ALX3000 interlock comes with a standard 1 year warranty that will cover manufacturing faults and defects. If you regularly calibrate your device at least once a year, we will extend the warranty on this device for up to 3 years.<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["category_mjwUde","question_xmif3M","question_w77zGA","question_7d7HnF","question_RQFKXP","question_7tUxeQ"],"settings":{"heading":"Available only in Victoria, Australia at the moment","heading_align":"text-start","color_scheme":"1","full_width":false}},"17084926091c6dc273":{"type":"apps","blocks":{"judge_me_reviews_review_widget_ihAfNE":{"type":"shopify:\/\/apps\/judge-me-reviews\/blocks\/review_widget\/61ccd3b1-a9f2-4160-9fe9-4fec8413e5d8","settings":{"review_data":"sample_data","max_width":1200,"show_shop_reviews":false,"empty_state":"empty_widget"}}},"block_order":["judge_me_reviews_review_widget_ihAfNE"],"settings":{"full_width":false}},"recommendations":{"type":"product-recommendations","settings":{"heading":"You may also like","heading_align":"text-start","layout":"carousel","card_size_mobile":"small","card_size":"small","products_to_show":5}},"product_comparison_grid_KAQHyU":{"type":"product-comparison-grid","blocks":{"product_d697KV":{"type":"product","settings":{"show_image":true,"show_title":true,"show_button":false}},"price_C7WVVg":{"type":"price","settings":{}},"description_exPVAM":{"type":"description","disabled":true,"settings":{"truncate_description":true,"words_to_show":15}},"metafield_eEiW7N":{"type":"metafield","settings":{"title":"Summary","metafield_key":"descriptors.subtitle"}},"metafield_Xp9g9Y":{"type":"metafield","disabled":true,"se